body: |-
  HEADLINE NUMBERS: churn-validated flag rate = 1.1% of git-clean merges (1 per ~92). Precision structure UNPREDICTED by any panelist: flag-set size inversely predicts payoff — hits with ≤6 flagged symbols were 50% churn-validated (3/6); ALL 12 hits with ≥10 symbols (incl. all seven 48-176-symbol avalanches) were 0%. SMALL KNOTS ARE THE PRODUCT — knot-size ranking isn't noise control, it's the signal itself.

  PITCH CORRECTION (critical honesty): 0/18 were cross-branch INTERACTION defects — all 3 CAUGHT-LATER defects were single-side-authored and shipped THROUGH clean merges. The evidenced Guard pitch = "green-gates defects shipping through clean merges, localized to 2-4 symbols, invisible to tsc+tests" (type-level defects where runtime tests are blind — zod ZodRecord 8/8 green at M). The multi-agent-interference pitch remains UNEVIDENCED in 275 real merges — it rides on Move-3 dogfooding, not on this data.

  PANEL SCORING: Jinx's 80% all-benign prior — right about interaction-benignity, falsified on 'all' (3/18 real, paid fixes in 1-6 days). North's existential tsc-column — answered decisively in Guard's favor (0/18). North's conditional Guard 6-7/10 zone REACHED, conditional on shipping knot-size/direct-contested ranking. ⚠️ results.md's flagship xstate e66662e1 case study ground-truthed BENIGN (no break, zero graph.ts churn) — must not be used in marketing; the real star is zod 66cbfe09/ZodRecord.

  DETAILS: zod 69ff844b = pre-existing red branch imported through clean merge (P2 11/33 fail), fixed next day at flagged symbol. xstate 7b808af4 = 4-symbol flag, +2d bad-import fix (invisible to monorepo tsc, breaks published consumers) + +6d failing-test-first path-dedup fix, both at flagged symbols. Evidence: .paradigm/research/warpline-guard-base-rate/ground-truth.{md,jsonl} (18 raw records, 51 typechecks, negative control verified).

  NEXT (queued): base-rate RE-RUN with the v1.1 lens (6.2% was a lower bound — the false-EQUAL hole caused missed flags, esp. nest/decorator-native) + ground-truth NEW hits only; then knot-size ranking into oracle output (T-2026-07-02-002 remaining half); then Arky design pass (v1-prefix anchor + v3 DAG identity) and Move-3 dogfood.
